# Test fixture directories
*_test/
test_*/
testdata/

# C4M files and bundles
*.c4m
*.c4m_bundle/
*_bundle/

# Cross-implementation conformance vectors are the contract, not fixtures:
# every implementation in the suite is verified against these exact bytes.
# They live under testdata/ and end in .c4m, so both rules above would drop
# them silently — which has already happened once. Re-include them
# explicitly. Git cannot re-include a path whose parent directory is
# excluded, so the parent is negated first.
!c4m/testdata/
!c4m/testdata/*-vector/
!c4m/testdata/*-vector/**

